2026-10-09T01:07:01.8916488Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8916975Z E           - paragraph: You can budget an approximate cost of €800.00 per person in shared accommodation.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8917117Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8917324Z E           - group: 再看 1 則資料
