2026-10-09T01:07:01.8918573Z E           - heading "每月生活預算" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8918721Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8919157Z E           - paragraph: SafeHouse will help you look for accommodations, according to your criteria and budget!
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8919292Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8919450Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8920265Z E           - paragraph: The CVEC contribution fees are used to fund various social, health, cultural, and athletic services for students, and to strengthen prevention and health education initiatives.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8920413Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8920572Z E           - group: 再看 1 則資料
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8920712Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8920809Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8920999Z E           - heading "飲食與採買" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8921135Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8921716Z E           - paragraph: "TSH will provide you with a premium and extraordinary student experience: pool, restaurant, gym, co-working spaces etc."
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8921856Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8921990Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8922612Z E           - paragraph: Whether you enjoy going out, eating great food, or learning new things, Paris has so much to offer that you won"t have time to get bored!
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8922761Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8922893Z E           - text: AI 推論
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8923143Z E           - paragraph: 可將這些地點列為用餐與採買候選，再比對上課校區及宿舍位置。
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8923280Z E           - group: 推論依據
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8923416Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8923516Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8923698Z E           - heading "交通與地點" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8923833Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8924548Z E           - paragraph: Their hybrid format, which combines a tablet with a laptop, provides flexibility and agility, making it easier to transport and use in all circumstances.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8924684Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8924825Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8925677Z E           - paragraph: To get around the city, you are eligible for a special student rate on your "Pass Navigo" transportation card that will allow you unlimited access to Paris's public transportation system.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8926062Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8926215Z E           - group: 再看 1 則資料
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8926351Z E           - text: AI 推論
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8926569Z E           - paragraph: 可比較住宿到上述站點的路線，評估通勤選擇。
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8926713Z E           - group: 推論依據
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8926849Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8926944Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8927139Z E           - heading "課業與教學" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8927277Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8927822Z E           - paragraph: This assistance is, of course, 100% digital and free!
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8927981Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8928122Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8929574Z E           - paragraph: ICD Business School, French Grande École established in 1980 is recognized for the quality of its courses and its innovative pedagogical approach, welcomes students from our partner Universities around the world to explore our campuses and the cities of Paris, Lyon and Toulouse.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8929736Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8929868Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8929971Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8930159Z E           - heading "氣候與穿著" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8930392Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8931019Z E           - paragraph: On average, utilities will cost an additional 10 % to 15 % on top of your rent, and possibly more in winter due to the use of heating systems.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8931160Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8931291Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8931391Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8931584Z E           - heading "校園活動與社交" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8931718Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8932522Z E           - paragraph: Thanks to a partnership negotiated by your Club Office, take advantage of favorable rates on the VITALITY package (€340 instead of €659 for one year).
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8932675Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8932818Z E           - text: 官方 · 機器翻譯
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8934014Z E           - paragraph: ICD 僅接受合作校提名申請。巴黎 與 Toulouse 2026–27 交換資訊表 均列秋季 5月15日提名、6 月 15 日申請；春季 10 月 15 日提名、11 月 1 日申請，但未標年度的 傳入的 頁把春季 申請 寫成 15 11月，兩者衝突，應以當期校區 交換資訊表 與長庚通知再次確認，不能直接建立提醒。一般門檻包含 GPA 2.5／4 或 B、英語 TOEFL iBT 70／B2（法語課程 B2）及每學期 25–30 ECTS；圖盧茲 不可混選不同年級或授課語言，課程也可能調整。
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8934164Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8934296Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8934399Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8934590Z E           - heading "安全、醫療與保險" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8934731Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8935192Z E           - paragraph: It takes care of transferring all of your contracts for you (energy, internet, insurance, mail).
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8935473Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8935619Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8936407Z E           - paragraph: All students in France, including foreign students who reside in France for more than 3 months, benefit from the free government health insurance.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8936544Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8936681Z E           - text: AI 推論
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8936942Z E           - paragraph: 可先查詢上述健康服務；接診、語言與保險適用性仍須確認。
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8937073Z E           - group: 推論依據
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8937210Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8937305Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8937639Z E           - heading "文化適應與交朋友" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8937789Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8938448Z E           - paragraph: Free for all, and without conditions regarding nationality, this card gives access to dozens of cultural, civic and athletic events every month.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8938590Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8938740Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8939344Z E           - paragraph: The International Office is here to help you prepare your stay, so please feel free to contact us with any questions you might have!
